---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Village Drill in Kenya | Community Transformation Trust" description="CT Trust is helping a record-breaking drill team in Kenya double their impact, bringing clean water to more communities than ever before.">
  <div class="report-banner-wrap">
    <img class="report-banner" src="/images/water.png" alt="" loading="eager" />
  </div>
  <article class="wrap report-article">
    <h1>Village Drill in Kenya</h1>
    <div class="detail-meta"><span>2026</span><span>Kenya</span></div>
    <p class="detail-lead">In Kenya, CT Trust is helping a record-breaking drill team double their impact, funding the resources they need to bring clean water to twice as many communities.</p>

    <section class="reveal">
      <h3>Doubling a proven impact</h3>
      <p>A record-breaking drill team has already brought clean water to community after community. The challenge is not skill or commitment, it is capacity: demand for safe water far outstrips what a single team can deliver.</p>
      <p>By funding the resources they need to reach twice as many communities, CT Trust is investing in people who have already proven what they can do.</p>
      <img class="report-photo" src="/images/water.png" alt="Drill team bringing clean water to a Kenyan community" loading="lazy" />
    </section>

    <section class="reveal">
      <h3>Why we back this team</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>A proven, record-breaking local team with a track record of results.</li>
        <li>Funding directly expands the number of communities served.</li>
        <li>Community-led and locally maintained water sources.</li>
        <li>High impact per dollar thanks to established local expertise.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="reveal">
      <h3>The lasting difference</h3>
      <p>When you support a team that is already succeeding, every extra resource multiplies. This project turns proven capability into more wells, more healthy families, and more communities with water that lasts.</p>
    </section>
  </article>
</Layout>
